{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Saddle up for a taste of adventure and creativity!</h2><br>Jump into the whimsical world of Hobby Horse with this free Demo Version and discover the joy of DIY horse riding, obstacle courses, and endless customization - all from the comfort of your own room.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your First Hobby Horse in the Demo Version</h2>Start your journey by crafting your very own hobby horse! Choose from a selection of demo colors, shapes, and accessories to give your trusty steed a unique look. Show off your creativity and get ready to ride in style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/a3274ff2358f0958d1d4eb11337fb272.poster.avif?t=1760182898\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/a3274ff2358f0958d1d4eb11337fb272.webm?t=1760182898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/a3274ff2358f0958d1d4eb11337fb272.mp4?t=1760182898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tackle First Three Exciting Obstacle Courses in the Demo Version</h2>Test your skills on a variety of demo obstacle courses, from cozy indoor gyms to challenging outdoor tracks. Run, jump, and leap over hurdles as you master the basics of hobby horse riding. Can you beat your best time and earn your first trophies?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/6c8743e69bfd576eca72e4c16c4c803e.poster.avif?t=1760182898\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/6c8743e69bfd576eca72e4c16c4c803e.webm?t=1760182898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/6c8743e69bfd576eca72e4c16c4c803e.mp4?t=1760182898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Up and Leap Higher</h2>Discover special boosters scattered across the demo courses! Grab a speed burst to dash past the competition or catch an air boost to soar over the tallest jumps. Experiment with different hobby horses to find the perfect balance of speed and jump height.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/234f4dfca47d79b743beba36e81805b0.poster.avif?t=1760182898\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/234f4dfca47d79b743beba36e81805b0.webm?t=1760182898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/234f4dfca47d79b743beba36e81805b0.mp4?t=1760182898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Personalize and Shine</h2>Even in the demo, your hobby horse can stand out! Mix and match demo accessories and colors to create a look that\u2019s all your own. Snap a screenshot of your creation and share your style with friends.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/2c4067705f87ac68d20a06e89c293f10.poster.avif?t=1760182898\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/2c4067705f87ac68d20a06e89c293f10.webm?t=1760182898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/extras/2c4067705f87ac68d20a06e89c293f10.mp4?t=1760182898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hands-on Preview in the Demo Version - Experience the core gameplay of riding, jumping, and customizing your hobby horse.</h2><br> Share your feedback and help us make Hobby Horse even better.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Get the basics down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090850/e49d6697565d079d0bcbd0d66312c500fa18cfdf.jpg"},{"name":"Modification freak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090850/a1da7ec27e3976951d9bfd412174890debd7ec8e.jpg"},{"name":"You never skipped P.E, huh?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090850/c205139bf846b933855a9776725ce3461d869480.jpg"},{"name":"A nature walk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090850/10cbeac04ce002dbeb3b7dee449cc8c030dcffda.jpg"},{"name":"You've been gnomed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090850/5330da071b2259202d1283d21f36a788e5ea32ea.jpg"},{"name":"D\u00e9j\u00e0 vu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090850/5dc836489fef982318e7ce4685052819b78728f8.jpg"},{"name":"Looking snatched","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090850/54f114147179757a449bf4de1a2561cb90e6bd7f.jpg"},{"name":"What's this?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090850/025e5fe234f063c6180efbd2f4a14c32ce4b3637.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4090850?t=1760182898","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/16f24e6645696c8219937d63d0c28218146b5524/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760182898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090850/9b3cdbe90aac67f840cfb43a680afc44854db5d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760182898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai